Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照这样下去 我赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 准备做下一组动作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是干什...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么呢 距离全国锦标赛就剩一周了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精力训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大家各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:01:01.93,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:06.10,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:11.73,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:15.90,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:21.74,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:24.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:26.21,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:29.42,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:35.34,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.88,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.47,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:41.68,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:48.35,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.85,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:54.86,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.99,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:03.16,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:01:01.93,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:06.10,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:11.73,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:15.90,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:21.74,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:24.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:26.21,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:29.42,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:35.34,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.88,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.47,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:41.68,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:48.35,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.85,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:54.86,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.99,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:03.16,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻笑什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看谁发的消息呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱发的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的昵称也叫saku啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.68,0:02:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始尖子的翻转太不整齐太难看了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舞蹈动作拖泥带水
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结尾处 所有人的表情和死了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱是我高中时代的队友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我常把我们的训练视频发给她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请她提一些意见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抖M吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受虐狂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真为翔感到高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 他终于解开了心结
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说了没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:03:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 回家路上去医院 我陪你去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卓巳 身体不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 刚才好像咳嗽来着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实没什么事 哥哥他...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小子从小身体弱 我不放心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小题大做 今天我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人只有独立了才算得上是男人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该独立的人 是我才对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小学初中高中乃至大学我俩都是一起上的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但将来就不可能了 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分别又很寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我放弃柔道的时候 难不成...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐也觉得很寂寞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是阿晴的姐姐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是她 真努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 陪她一块儿跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还得去打工吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去跟老板说一声阿晴晚点到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 我想说 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听说了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直输的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你要参加全国啦啦队锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得加油比赛 不用管我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么一直在擦这个杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有烦恼 可以和我聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我不确定自己能不能像你和阿一那样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给出适当的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你可以和我聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去扫厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 祝贺我们都通过了预赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又撞了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的巧克力蛋糕果然好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你也这样觉得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教我做法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店长出去了 等他回来我帮你问
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你回头能给我发消息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 给你添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就是情人节了 我想加把劲做做看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是成功了带给你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我算是明白了你集中不了精神的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别像预赛时那样失误不断啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那个 不是因为这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和哥哥吵架了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得自己该多练练
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 2 DOWN UP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多用用全身
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢教练
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久别太心急
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多做想象训练 想象自已顺利完成的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天不训练 但大家记得自己练
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解散
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢教练
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 我得去打工 先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天来我家练习吗 金和尚史也来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 2 DOWN UP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以啊佐久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的转身
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我跟大家一起做动作的时候总做不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起啊 我这么软弱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从小就爱哭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都说我的姐姐们比我更像男人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有姐姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有姐姐真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的姐姐们可不像锅岛哥那么贴心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥对我担心过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找工作也不轻松 我希望他能多关心一下自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则老被哥哥这么担心着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都快讨厌自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 家家有本难念的经啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴也有姐姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我俩以前一起练柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可姐姐一直都比我厉害得多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家也是 哥哥比我强太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家也...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点庆幸今天来训练了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本是因为怕在家里见到哥哥会尴尬才出的门
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但就像阿晴说的一想到家家都有本难念的经
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心里就轻松了些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是三个小老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然很想向哥哥道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前不该对他说「不要担心我」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久也回家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 如果可以的话能帮我个忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情人节... 不是女生做巧克力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用纠结这种小事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之所以会想要加入啦啦队 全都是因为阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想谢谢他 于是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一喜欢什么样的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该喜欢加了杏仁的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 那就把这个裹上巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做个四周洒满可可粉的杏仁巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 你在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好浓的巧克力味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是啦啦队的佐久间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是晴子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这阵子你到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于知道自己想说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然很想向哥哥道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想向你道歉 不该瞒着你放弃柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 我不是因为受伤才放弃的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想了很久自己是不是应该继续练柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烦恼了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那个时候起...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说姐姐被前辈打败了 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羨慕晴希啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是男生该多好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想变得比所有人都强
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也曾想过 换作是我会不会执着到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望自己是女生 而姐姐是男生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我思考过无数次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渐渐的 我只有身高超过了姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可比赛成绩却完全不如姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说 我让你进退两难？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.23,0:12:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我自己觉得...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望只因为家里是开道场的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只因为崇拜姐姐 所以练柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想找到属于我的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 晴希你...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走上了与我不同的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我所拥有的只有柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你姐姐肯定能理解你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说不一定是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久 这次转身非常利索
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥 佐久成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望在正式比赛也能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得能行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定让自己这样认为
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也按教练说的做了想象训练
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是做不做得到 是一定要做到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到能从身边的伙伴口中听到这么精彩的发言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而非某个陌生人的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久间 我也好感动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久 够男人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 不过是友情巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴希你很期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想要手工巧克力蛋糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔、翔告诉你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今年可能没收获
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 应该至少能拿到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情人节快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么送给阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一可能不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学园祭那次是你拉了我一把
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是、是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才看到了啦啦队表演
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是现在 我才会站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为表感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太多了吃不完 不介意的话请收下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁要你剩下的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢巧克力 多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我连义理巧克力都没收到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥送我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.28,0:15:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 只有卓巳送我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好空虚的礼物交换
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨送我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢我帮她买东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.71,0:15:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有女朋友的家伙真淡定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么远野有女朋友 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没收到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过她说今年做巧克力蛋糕送我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巧克力蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说有一家店的巧克力蛋糕超好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去打听了做法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在很流行这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浩司
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小千
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿远的女朋友是DREAMS的女生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪对啦啦队这么熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴抱歉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么道歉啊 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作啊 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 这是送给大家的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等啦 情人节特制心形猪排咖喱乌冬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃的时候得把心弄碎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心碎乌冬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千裕和阿远一起把巧克为蛋糕送到了高田牧舍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔说等打完工就拿到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好哎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很苦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有我们呢 打起精神来 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若是能心动 哪怕只有一瞬间也叫人羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这句太直白了 是谁的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涉·沟口
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算今后都说自己想说的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再借用他人的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来 我对任何事都缺乏经验 光说不练
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但参加了啦啦队 和许多人有交流之后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才弄清了许多一直以来没弄懂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没看清的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来为了赢 棒球也好其他运动也好 我参加了许多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但像这样大家齐心协力去做一件事 还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确 通过啦啦队我明白了太多事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 我明白了自己和别人不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才会遇到很多麻烦又有趣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...觉得虽然认真做一件事很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也明白了 要是想让别人露出笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得让自己先面带笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都跨越了各自的坎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要跨越我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会找到好姑娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了介绍给我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿远那小子要去约会了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真气人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把心碎乌冬的照片发给他看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 我不该瞎起哄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 明年的情人节我一定赢过你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道完歉顺便提醒你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天有大学校际冬季赛 柔道的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可明天还得训练
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为现场比赛加油助威 不也是啦啦队的训练吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天训练我请假
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 你会赢的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 进攻进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有好好加油
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 成功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.37,0:20:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的应援貌似奏了效
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟给她加油的是我们BREAKERS的王牌尖子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迟到的情人节礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子 多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 你这是大甩卖的巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能收到亲人巧克力的人没资格抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年我还收到了教练巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有什么可骄傲的 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 好久没练了 来练练柔道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是晴子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.15,0:22:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全国锦标赛 我也会去看的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:22.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}有苦有甜的情人节
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:25.80,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:27.42,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:30.18,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.55,0:22:35.85,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大声回应
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:39.44,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,崭新大门打开的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:42.52,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像紧紧握住的拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:45.86,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,决意坚定地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散发的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:52.66,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话感觉能改变些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:59.00,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.46,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,没有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.71,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:07.59,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要输
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上应援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:13.80,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打气的动作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.93,0:23:17.18,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.31,0:23:20.77,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂头丧气抱怨「到极限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:24.11,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破极限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:27.44,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS ＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:30.61,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:33.95,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的姿势＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:37.08,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,连同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:40.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着邂逅闪耀笑容的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:48.46,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.55,0:22:35.85,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:39.44,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:42.52,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:45.86,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:52.66,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:59.00,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.46,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.71,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:07.59,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.17,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:13.80,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.93,0:23:17.18,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.31,0:23:20.77,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:24.11,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:27.44,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:30.61,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:33.95,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:37.08,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:40.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B R E A K E R S
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.68,0:24:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET‘S GO 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FOR LOVE & PEACE
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 男子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
